This extension implements the FreeFuse algorithm described by Yaoli Liu,
Yao-Xiang Ding, and Kun Zhou and studies the Apache-2.0 reference code at:
https://github.com/yaoliliu/FreeFuse

Reference revision: 7a76c3ac43ef3c27c7a3f8126e29e6021d837c80
Reference license: Apache License 2.0

The Forge Neo/Anima runtime integration is an independent implementation.

Deviation from the reference: its foreground cleanup (mask_utils.py) resizes
the one-token-larger output of each padded 2x2 max pool back to the grid,
which shifts the foreground by about two tokens down and right. This port
crops that output instead, keeping the reference's 2x2 opening and closing
without moving the mask.
